# infix_notation_associativity — infix notation and associativity
# (README §8). Tests infix operator associativity.

InfixNotationAssociativity is project
InfixNotationAssociativity module examplesInfixNotationAssociativity
InfixNotationAssociativity target console
InfixNotationAssociativity entry main

examplesInfixNotationAssociativity is module
examplesInfixNotationAssociativity path examples.infixNotationAssociativity
examplesInfixNotationAssociativity exports main
